<p>Use this dialog box to edit and create watermarks.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>You cannot update or delete system-provided watermarks.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="image" role="heading">Watermark Image</p>
<p>Displays an image of the watermark as it appears on the page.</p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>The displayed watermark image may differ from 
 actual prints.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="watermark" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Watermarks:</span></p>
<p>Select the watermark that you want to edit or delete from the list.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="watermarkdelete" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Delete</span></p>
<p>Deletes the current watermark.</p>
<p aria-level="2" class="T1" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Edit</span></p>
<p>Use the following settings to control the appearance of the watermark.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="name" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Name:</span></p>
<p>Enter a name for the watermark.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="text" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Text:</span></p>
<p>Enter the watermark text.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="font" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Font:</span></p>
<p>Select the font type for the watermark text.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="fontstyle" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Font Style:</span></p>
<p>Select the font style for the watermark text.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="color" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Color:</span></p>
<p>Select the color for the watermark text.</p>
<p>With black and white printing, the density of gray color changes.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="frame" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Frame/Outline:</span></p>
<p>Select an ornament of font style.</p>
<p><span class="Term-Soft">Rectangle</span> frames the text with a rectangle.</p>
<p><span class="Term-Soft">Circle</span> frames the text with a circle.</p>
<p><span class="Term-Soft">Outlined</span> prints the text in outline form.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="size" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Size:</span></p>
<p>Specify a value in this spin box to adjust the size of the current watermark.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="angle" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Angle:</span></p>
<p>Specify a value in this spin box to rotate the watermark about its central 
 point.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="density" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Density:</span></p>
<p>Specify a value in this spin box to adjust the density of the current 
 watermark.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="add" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Add</span></p>
<p>Adds an edited watermark as a new watermark to the list.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="update" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Update</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes after editing a watermark.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="position" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Position:</span></p>
<p>Select a printing position where you want to print a watermark.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="first" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">First Page Only</span></p>
<p>Prints the watermark on the first page only.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="opaque" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Opaque</span></p>
<p>Makes the watermark opaque. The image under the watermark will not be 
 visible.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="repeat" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Repeat</span></p>
<p>Prints watermarks repeatedly from the top left of the page.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="original" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Per Original Page</span></p>
<p>Print watermark on each original page even when <span class="Term-Soft">Layout</span> 
 or <span class="Term-Soft">Booklet</span> setting is applied.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="ok" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">OK</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes and closes the dialog box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="cancel" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Cancel</span></p>
<p>Closes the dialog box without saving any changes.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="help" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Help</span></p>
<p>Displays Help for the dialog box opened.</p>
<hr/>
